Ok, lets analyze your situation:

You have MR, reflection, AC of -25.  Your stats are very good.
You have slow digestion and can cast spells without hunger.
You do not have mana regeneration, nor curse absorbing.
You are very fast, and you have a magic whistle.

Do you still have 7 candles?  If you don't, you might need to save a
wish for that.
You will probably need a reliable source of levitation.  A wish for a
ring would not be unreasonable.

There are a few tricks you can use to minimize the damage that losing
the Eye and Magicbane did.
1) You can convert to neutral, and wish for the PYEC.
2) You can convert or [HoOA to lawful, and wish for the Magic mirror

Converting or using the [HoOA will cost you any purchased protection,
but with a little patience altar camping or pudding farming  will give
it all back. In fact, a pudding farm can get your intrinsic AC down to
-128.  It can also get you 7 candles without using a wish.

There is also a trick for boosting your Pw into the tens of thousands.
It involves using a vampire or wraith to drain one level from you while
you are NOT wearing the [HoBrill, then retreating onto a burned
Elbereth, wearing the [HoBrill, creating a monster, and killing it to
gain your level back, removing the helmet, then repeating the process
from the beginning.  When your energy is that high, it is very
difficult to drain it all, but if it does get drained, you can use a
"foocubus farm" to restore it quickly.

I usually play wishless, but here are a few suggestions for wishes that
you probably haven't heard yet.
1) a blessed rustproof athame (for Elbereth)
2) a can of grease ( for your cloak, bag, and helmet )
3) gauntlets of power ( if you are going to get MR from another
artifact and wear a robe)
4) ring of polymorph control - (mostly for making cockatrice eggs)

There are spells that you should make sure you know before you go much
further.
1) charm monster - ( can save you when you are surrounded much better
than the FoD )
2) create monster
3) identify
4) stone-to-flesh
5) magic missile
6) cone of cold - ( can save you in lava )
7) Haste self - ( if you want to switch to jumping boots )

I would recommend sacrificing for spellbooks if you lack any of those
spells.

If you play more carefully there is no reason why this character cannot
ascend.

Happy Hacking.


